+           calling the AES's timer hook, which would write into whatever DM
+           put there. What this machine has instead is the bulk arena: the
+           PRG-RAM between the end of the C: ramdisk and the servant's scratch,
+           which EmuTOS never allocates. The Sega CD driver says where it is,
+           through the 'SgCD' cookie and SCD_BULK_INFO, and it takes DM's
